# Runtime junk only. Login cookies and profile data ARE committed
# (owner decision 28.08.2026; this repo is PRIVATE-ONLY).
# Real secret files stay excluded by the repo-root .gitignore
# (local.json, *.token, *.pem, *.key, secrets/, etc.).
**/Cache/
**/Code Cache/
**/GPUCache/
**/GPUPersistentCache/
**/GrShaderCache/
**/ShaderCache/
**/Crashpad/
**/BrowserMetrics/
**/*.pma
**/SingletonLock
**/SingletonCookie
**/SingletonSocket
**/lockfile
**/*.lock
**/CrashpadMetrics*
**/component_crx_cache/
**/optimization_guide_model_store/
# Chrome Privacy Sandbox component (not owner cookies); name contains Token.
**/TrustTokenKeyCommitments/

# Chrome/Edge component-updater payloads (regenerable, binary; not login state).
# Untracked 2026-10-31 to clear mcp-audit CRLF + no-runtime-junk; same class as the caches above.
**/CertificateRevocation/
**/Crowd Deny/
**/FileTypePolicies/
**/PKIMetadata/
**/Safe Browsing/
**/Safe Browsing Network/
**/Subresource Filter/
**/ZxcvbnData/
**/OnDeviceHeadSuggestModel/
**/OptimizationGuideModelsManifest/
**/OptimizationHints/
**/SSLErrorAssistant/
**/AutofillAiModelCache/
**/AutofillStrikeDatabase/
**/PersistentOriginTrials/
